<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>ヒグチアイ</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">铁铸的子弹 成了宣扬正义的明证</text><text for="L2">只要洞穿敌膛 便自以为更靠近了英雄</text><text for="L3">试着阖上双眼 伸手触碰</text><text for="L4">那所谓的恶魔 却有着相同的轮廓与温热的体温</text><text for="L5">为何我罪无可赦 他们却理所应当</text><text for="L6">明明仅仅是因为 眼前曾耸立着那道高墙</text><text for="L7">切莫哀叹降生于世的宿命</text><text for="L8">因为我们每一个人 生来便是自由的</text><text for="L9">若能像飞鸟那样 展翅拥有一双羽翼</text><text for="L10">天地虽大 固然能飞往任何地方</text><text for="L11">可若失去了能归去的容身之所</text><text for="L12">便注定无处可去 沦为迷途之鸟</text><text for="L13">我绝不甘愿仅仅浑浑噩噩苟活于世</text><text for="L14">世界何其残酷 纵然如此我也依然深爱着你</text><text for="L15">即便倾尽一切代价 无论如何我也要守护你</text><text for="L16">纵使这前路万劫不复 我也决不产生丝毫动摇</text><text for="L17">所谓正义 便是自始至终坚信自己的选择</text><text for="L18">钢铁之雨 倾泻呼啸而下的景象</text><text for="L19">在萤幕之中 宛如事不关己的电影一般</text><text for="L20">所谓的战争 不过是愚昧野蛮的暴行</text><text for="L21">全然无关 发生在未知异邦的虚构传说</text><text for="L22">既然如此 为何心底又对那人充满仇恨</text><text for="L23">那翻涌滋长的漆黑恶意 无法遮掩的根源</text><text for="L24">我甚至无法用言语辨白分毫</text><text for="L25">人类自身 怎会充斥着如此无尽的矛盾</text><text for="L26">哪怕这番话语 被转译传颂</text><text for="L27">其中真正的份量 也再无法如实传达</text><text for="L28">唯一能够坚信的 唯有自己睁开双眸</text><text for="L29">亲手触碰感知过的真实天地</text><text for="L30">苟延残喘的虚妄偷生 我绝不接受</text><text for="L31">这个世界何其残酷 可我依然毫无保留地爱着你</text><text for="L32">纵然将万物化作牺牲 我也定要护你周全到底</text><text for="L33">所择之人的背影 弃绝之物的累累尸骸</text><text for="L34">我猛然惊觉 在自身心渊之中 悄然孕育生长的正是恶魔之子</text><text for="L35">在正义的反面 在无尽的牺牲深处 我心之中寄宿着恶魔之子</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="悪魔の子"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ヒグチアイ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="悪魔の子 - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1601391184"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPPC02210021"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:01.052" end="3:24.849"><p begin="0:01.052" end="0:03.794" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:01.052" end="0:01.604">鉄の</span><span begin="0:01.604" end="0:02.404">弾が</span> <span begin="0:02.404" end="0:03.070">正義の</span><span begin="0:03.070" end="0:03.794">証明</span></p><p begin="0:03.804" end="0:06.463" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:03.804" end="0:04.671">貫けば</span> <span begin="0:04.778" end="0:05.596">英雄に</span><span begin="0:05.596" end="0:06.463">近づいた</span></p><p begin="0:06.463" end="0:09.007" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:06.463" end="0:07.191">その目を</span><span begin="0:07.191" end="0:07.789">閉じて</span> <span begin="0:07.789" end="0:08.459">触れてみ</span><span begin="0:08.459" end="0:09.007">れば</span></p><p begin="0:09.117" end="0:13.823" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:09.117" end="0:09.624">同じ</span><span begin="0:09.624" end="0:10.157">形</span> <span begin="0:10.157" end="0:10.757">同じ</span><span begin="0:10.757" end="0:11.941">体温の悪</span><span begin="0:11.941" end="0:13.823">魔</span></p><p begin="0:14.459" end="0:17.018" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.459" end="0:15.422">僕はダメ</span><span begin="0:15.422" end="0:15.771">で</span> <span begin="0:15.771" end="0:16.720">あいつはいい</span><span begin="0:16.720" end="0:17.018">の？</span></p><p begin="0:17.128" end="0:19.813" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.128" end="0:17.592">そこに</span><span begin="0:17.592" end="0:18.471">壁が</span><span begin="0:18.471" end="0:19.813">あっただけなのに</span></p><p begin="0:19.823" end="0:22.439" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:19.823" end="0:20.431">生まれて</span><span begin="0:20.431" end="0:21.130">しまった</span> <span begin="0:21.130" end="0:21.596">運命</span><span begin="0:21.596" end="0:22.439">嘆くな</span></p><p begin="0:22.449" end="0:26.273" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.449" end="0:22.940">僕ら</span><span begin="0:22.940" end="0:23.790">はみんな</span> <span begin="0:23.790" end="0:24.484">自由</span><span begin="0:24.484" end="0:25.289">なんだか</span><span begin="0:25.289" end="0:26.273">ら</span></p><p begin="0:26.283" end="0:31.487" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.283" end="0:27.011">鳥</span><span begin="0:27.011" end="0:28.011">のよう</span><span begin="0:28.011" end="0:28.800">に</span> <span begin="0:29.027" end="0:30.677">羽があれ</span><span begin="0:30.677" end="0:31.487">ば</span></p><p begin="0:31.587" end="0:36.798" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.587" end="0:32.654">どこへ</span><span begin="0:32.654" end="0:33.821">だって</span><span begin="0:33.987" end="0:35.221">行け</span><span begin="0:35.221" end="0:35.957">るけ</span><span begin="0:35.957" end="0:36.798">ど</span></p><p begin="0:36.908" end="0:40.939" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.908" end="0:37.985">帰る</span><span begin="0:37.985" end="0:38.652">場所</span><span begin="0:38.652" end="0:39.412">が</span> <span begin="0:39.670" end="0:40.939">なければ</span></p><p begin="0:40.949" end="0:46.378" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:40.949" end="0:42.658">きっとど</span><span begin="0:42.658" end="0:43.176">こ</span><span begin="0:43.176" end="0:43.976">へも行</span><span begin="0:43.976" end="0:45.144">けな</span><span begin="0:45.144" end="0:46.378">い</span></p><p begin="0:46.388" end="0:51.603" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.388" end="0:47.111">ただ</span><span begin="0:47.111" end="0:47.727">ただ</span><span begin="0:47.727" end="0:48.025">生</span><span begin="0:48.025" end="0:49.276">きるのは</span><span begin="0:49.276" end="0:50.060">嫌</span><span begin="0:50.060" end="0:51.603">だ</span></p><p begin="0:51.783" end="1:02.514" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:51.783" end="0:53.789">世界は</span><span begin="0:54.031" end="0:54.697">残</span><span begin="0:54.697" end="0:55.983">酷</span><span begin="0:55.983" end="0:57.058">だ</span> <span begin="0:57.316" end="0:59.109">それでも</span><span begin="0:59.316" end="1:00.281">君を</span><span begin="1:00.281" end="1:01.265">愛す</span><span begin="1:01.265" end="1:02.514">よ</span></p><p begin="1:02.614" end="1:12.449" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.614" end="1:03.326">な</span><span begin="1:03.326" end="1:03.892">にを</span><span begin="1:03.892" end="1:04.593">犠</span><span begin="1:04.593" end="1:05.292">牲</span><span begin="1:05.292" end="1:06.157">に</span><span begin="1:06.157" end="1:06.688">して</span><span begin="1:06.688" end="1:07.689">も</span> <span begin="1:07.939" end="1:08.590">そ</span><span begin="1:08.590" end="1:09.804">れでも</span><span begin="1:10.006" end="1:10.955">君を</span><span begin="1:10.955" end="1:12.449">守るよ</span></p><p begin="1:12.559" end="1:17.640" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.559" end="1:13.301">間違い</span><span begin="1:13.301" end="1:15.026">だとしても</span> <span begin="1:15.317" end="1:15.967">疑っ</span><span begin="1:15.967" end="1:17.640">たりしない</span></p><p begin="1:17.750" end="1:24.681" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.750" end="1:18.681">正しさと</span><span begin="1:18.681" end="1:18.985">は</span> <span begin="1:19.195" end="1:20.350">自分のこと</span> <span begin="1:20.462" end="1:20.970">強く</span><span begin="1:20.970" end="1:22.595">信じること</span><span begin="1:22.595" end="1:24.681">だ</span></p><p begin="1:33.127" end="1:35.730" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.127" end="1:33.653">鉄の</span><span begin="1:33.653" end="1:34.434">雨が</span> <span begin="1:34.434" end="1:35.135">降り散る</span><span begin="1:35.135" end="1:35.730">情景</span></p><p begin="1:35.740" end="1:38.465" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.740" end="1:36.892">テレビの中</span> <span begin="1:36.892" end="1:37.476">映画</span><span begin="1:37.476" end="1:38.465">に見えたんだ</span></p><p begin="1:38.475" end="1:41.087" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.475" end="1:39.782">戦争なんて</span> <span begin="1:39.782" end="1:40.400">愚かな</span><span begin="1:40.400" end="1:41.087">凶暴</span></p><p begin="1:41.097" end="1:43.757" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.097" end="1:42.089">関係ない</span> <span begin="1:42.089" end="1:42.774">知らない</span><span begin="1:42.774" end="1:43.257">国の</span><span begin="1:43.257" end="1:43.757">話</span></p><p begin="1:43.767" end="1:46.366" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.767" end="1:45.092">それならなんで</span> <span begin="1:45.092" end="1:45.559">あいつ</span><span begin="1:45.559" end="1:46.366">憎んで</span></p><p begin="1:46.476" end="1:49.092" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.476" end="1:47.460">黒い気持ち</span> <span begin="1:47.460" end="1:48.092">隠し</span><span begin="1:48.092" end="1:49.092">きれない理由</span></p><p begin="1:49.102" end="1:51.666" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.102" end="1:50.454">説明だって</span> <span begin="1:50.454" end="1:51.111">できやし</span><span begin="1:51.111" end="1:51.666">ないんだ</span></p><p begin="1:51.776" end="1:57.906" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.776" end="1:53.040">僕らはなんて</span> <span begin="1:53.195" end="1:53.744">矛盾</span><span begin="1:53.744" end="1:54.629">ばっかなん</span><span begin="1:54.629" end="1:57.906">だ</span></p><p begin="2:16.921" end="2:22.194" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.921" end="2:17.609">この</span><span begin="2:17.609" end="2:18.644">言葉</span><span begin="2:18.644" end="2:19.363">も</span> <span begin="2:19.625" end="2:21.327">訳されれ</span><span begin="2:21.327" end="2:22.194">ば</span></p><p begin="2:22.264" end="2:27.510" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.264" end="2:23.606">本当の</span><span begin="2:23.606" end="2:25.206">意味は</span><span begin="2:25.206" end="2:25.755">伝</span><span begin="2:25.755" end="2:26.555">わら</span><span begin="2:26.555" end="2:27.510">ない</span></p><p begin="2:27.560" end="2:33.105" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:27.560" end="2:29.296">信じるの</span><span begin="2:29.296" end="2:30.024">は</span> <span begin="2:30.280" end="2:31.613">その目を</span><span begin="2:31.613" end="2:33.105">開いて</span></p><p begin="2:33.115" end="2:37.024" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.115" end="2:34.384">触れた</span><span begin="2:34.384" end="2:35.819">世界だ</span><span begin="2:35.819" end="2:37.024">け</span></p><p begin="2:37.134" end="2:44.857" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.134" end="2:37.774">ただ</span><span begin="2:37.774" end="2:38.425">ただ</span><span begin="2:38.425" end="2:40.838">生きるのは嫌</span><span begin="2:40.838" end="2:44.857">だ</span></p><p begin="2:45.637" end="2:56.258" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.637" end="2:47.643">世界は</span><span begin="2:47.885" end="2:48.551">残</span><span begin="2:48.551" end="2:49.837">酷</span><span begin="2:49.837" end="2:50.912">だ</span> <span begin="2:51.170" end="2:52.963">それでも</span><span begin="2:53.170" end="2:54.135">君を</span><span begin="2:54.135" end="2:55.119">愛す</span><span begin="2:55.119" end="2:56.258">よ</span></p><p begin="2:56.318" end="3:06.153" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.318" end="2:57.030">な</span><span begin="2:57.030" end="2:57.596">にを</span><span begin="2:57.596" end="2:58.297">犠</span><span begin="2:58.297" end="2:58.996">牲</span><span begin="2:58.996" end="2:59.936">に</span><span begin="2:59.936" end="3:00.392">して</span><span begin="3:00.392" end="3:01.393">も</span> <span begin="3:01.643" end="3:02.294">そ</span><span begin="3:02.294" end="3:03.508">れでも</span><span begin="3:03.710" end="3:04.659">君を</span><span begin="3:04.659" end="3:06.153">守るよ</span></p><p begin="3:06.241" end="3:11.483" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.241" end="3:07.038">選んだ</span><span begin="3:07.038" end="3:08.073">人の</span><span begin="3:08.073" end="3:08.905">影</span> <span begin="3:08.905" end="3:10.022">捨てたものの</span><span begin="3:10.022" end="3:11.483">屍</span></p><p begin="3:11.553" end="3:16.786" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.553" end="3:12.836">気づいたんだ</span> <span begin="3:12.913" end="3:14.039">自分の中</span> <span begin="3:14.163" end="3:15.011">育つのは</span><span begin="3:15.011" end="3:15.995">悪魔</span><span begin="3:15.995" end="3:16.786">の子</span></p><p begin="3:16.796" end="3:24.849" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:16.796" end="3:17.481">正義の</span><span begin="3:17.481" end="3:18.036">裏</span> <span begin="3:18.217" end="3:18.833">犠牲の</span><span begin="3:18.833" end="3:19.404">中</span> <span begin="3:19.516" end="3:20.049">心</span><span begin="3:20.049" end="3:20.348">には</span><span begin="3:20.348" end="3:21.714">悪魔の</span><span begin="3:21.714" end="3:24.849">子</span></p></div></body></tt>